<title>CHILE: Codelco sees 1.2 mln tns refined copper sales '97.</title>
<headline>Codelco sees 1.2 mln tns refined copper sales '97.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Codelco expects to sell 1.2 million tonnes of refined copper next year, including its share of production from the recently opened El Abra copper mine, said Juan Eduardo Herrera, vice president for sales.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect sales next year of 1.2 million tonnes plus of refined copper, which will include part of cathodes from El Abra,&quot; said Herrera.</p>
<p>He said Codelco had sold 1.05 million tonnes of refined copper this year. The figures included cathodes and fire-refined copper, Herrera told reporters.</p>
<p>--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
</text>
